{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40098","label":"ARK GUARDIAN · Part 1"},"label":"Close Your Eyes, Dream of the Past","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_arkguardian1_01_s","speakers":{"cecil":"Cecil","snowwhite_h_no":"Snow White"},"icons":{"cecil":"si_c929_00_s","snowwhite_h_no":"si_c9013_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_1","text":"How are you feeling?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Laboratory","bgArt":"laboratory","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_edenin","movie":null,"shown":["snowwhite_h_no","cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_2","text":"Fine...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_3","text":"On second thought, I feel great.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_4","text":"So this is what it's like to be able to move your body freely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_5","text":"I'd forgotten what this felt like.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_6","text":"Considering your condition, it's impressive any of you were able to move around on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_7","text":"What a complete mess. Not a single component was left intact.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_8","text":"Not only that, Scarlet's body is practically a mass-produced model in its current state. It's unbelievable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_9","text":"Yet despite all that, you both kept fighting. Most admirable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_10","text":"You're right. We are admirable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_11","text":"At present, your body has been completely repaired and even enhanced. Try to move as much as possible to acclimate to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_12","text":"How about the armaments? Do you like them? We tried to replicate them as closely as possible to what you used previously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_13","text":"They don't seem particularly strong. They're a bit too light in fact.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_14","text":"Weight has no bearing on power. Don't you know, technological advances begin with improvements in weight?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_15","text":"Even so, they feel far too light, and seem too weak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_16","text":"I'm telling you, they're not weak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_17","text":"Then load me up with additional weapons and ammunition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_18","text":"We finally succeeded in increasing performance while reducing weight. What's the point of making it heavier again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_19","text":"The more weapons, the better.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_20","text":"*Sigh* Fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_21","text":"Load me up to the limit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_22","text":"As you wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_23","text":"Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_24","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_25","text":"How are Scarlet and Rapunzel?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_26","text":"I managed to keep them alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_27","text":"Strictly speaking, their brains are being housed in the brain shelter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_28","text":"Their bodies are beyond repair and cannot be used.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_29","text":"That's a relief. Then when will they receive their new bodies?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_30","text":"That won't be possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_31","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_32","text":"Eden doesn't possess the technology to manufacture Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_33","text":"I don't understand. Then what have you been doing all this time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_34","text":"We can modify or repair pre-existing bodies,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_35","text":"but creating one from scratch is beyond our capabilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_36","text":"It's similar to how the Ark handles NIMPH.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_37","text":"When I escaped from the Ark, I took everything I could carry with me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_38","text":"However, I was merely an M.M.R. researcher. There was no way I could smuggle out Nikke production technology on top of everything else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_39","text":"That technology is entirely monopolized by the Big Three.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_40","text":"... So what happens now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_41","text":"We'll have to obtain it from the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_42","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_43","text":"That guy, {AccountData.NickName}, is making his way to Eden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_44","text":"I'm planning to have him request the Ark to transfer Nikke production technology to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_45","text":"And you're okay with doing that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_46","text":"Of course I'm not okay with it. It hurts both my pride and feelings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_47","text":"The same applies to Johan, obviously...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_48","text":"However, during our battle against the Queen, I realized something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_49","text":"We should've set aside our bullheaded pride and conviction and just focused on becoming stronger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_51","text":"If we had shared our technology with you and learned yours in return,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_52","text":"things might have turned out a lot differently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_53","text":"It's something I regret.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_54","text":"Though at this point, such insights are pointless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_55","text":"... I feel the same way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_56","text":"I took the Queen too lightly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_57","text":"I thought of her as something that existed only in concept,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_58","text":"and I figured that would be enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_59","text":"But I was far too complacent. I regret it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_60","text":"Yes...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_61","text":"If we obtain the Nikke production technology from the Ark, Noah can be restored as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_62","text":"... We can only hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_63","text":"... What about Harran and Isabel?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_64","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h_no","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_65","text":"... I'm sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_66","text":"No, it is all right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkguardian1_prologue_67","text":"Those two... heh. I never thought I would say this, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkguardian1_prologue_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"ceci